  "id": 922,
  "description": "## 🇦🇺All Australians Welcome! 🇦🇺\n\n### Core Guild Values\n\n- **Self-Enablement:** Everyone is eligible for the Deputy role from consistent contributions.\n  - You have a right to use the benefits of the guild from our shared efforts. \n  - You are also entrusted with activities such as recruitment &amp; promotions.\n- **Welcoming:** We want a range of combat levels to join our guild as low level resource contributions are always appreciated. We expect you will grow with the guild and receive support whenever possible.\n  - If you choose to leave, you will always be welcomed back and at the same rank you were before.\n- **No Discord:** This is a Semi-Casual guild with no plans to go competitive. After all, this is a casual game for a majority of us and there are too many guilds with discord requirements.\n\n\\_____________________________________________\n**📢 Announcement - 15 September**\n\nIt looks like Season 12 Assaults start this weekend. With Slayer being released lets try stack up a few skills at once - First Assault will be at Eldoria (Level 18). Feel free to scale the enemies as that gives you more xp for all skills, including guild mastery.\n\nBe sure to do some hunts and cook enough food before then.\n\n\\______________________________________________\n### Important Schedules\n\n**🕙 Raids Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- At this stage Deputies are free to schedule raids at times that suit them. We have a ridiculous amount of Marks to use up.\n- Generally 6pm, 8pm &amp; 9pm daily\n\n**⚔️ Assault Schedule**\n- Stay tuned for further details with Guild Season 12 starting this week.\n\n**🏊 Energising Pool**\n- Every Saturday Afternoon in September 12:00PM - 3:00PM\n\n\\______________________________________________\n\n### Hierarchy Progression\n\n**👑 Guild Leader Succession**\n\nIf a guild leader stops playing for a prolonged period, leadership will pass on to the most capable and willing deputy to continue our legacy.\n\n1. FabAsianZung (03/06/2025 - 31/08/2026)\n2. Drafiks (01/09/2026 - Current)\n3. N/A\n\n**🤴Promotion To Deputy**\n1. Consistent ingame activity. \n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Officer rank. \n\n**👮‍♂️Promotion To Officer**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Soldier rank. \n\n**🪖Promotion To Soldier**\n1. Deputies are free to decide, within 1 week of joining.\n2. Make an effort for guild contributions shortly after joining.\n\n**📃Accepting Recruit Applications**\n1. Combat level 40 or total level 500\n2. Ideally within Australia or a nearby region\n\n\\______________________________________________\n### Miscellaneous Extras\n\n- Alts are welcome in the guild however they may be kicked to make space for a new Main, based on lowest activity &amp; contributions.\n- We run by **AEST** (GMT+10) 🌏\n- If kicked for inactivity, feel free to come back when you are ready \n- New Zealanders are also welcome 🇳🇿\n\n**🚩Guild Founded: 3rd of June 2025 by FabAsianZung🚩**",
